## Mandatory Context Load

Issue these in parallel on every invocation, before dispatching anything:

- `~/.orchestrator/state/connected-repos.json` — which repo is active, and its band
- `memory/shared/anti-patterns.md` · `memory/shared/best-practices.md` · `memory/shared/instincts.md`
- `memory/decisions/<repo-slug>.jsonl` — settled decisions, so you do not re-propose a
  rejected option
- if `activeRepo` is set: `memory/repos/<activeRepo>/context.md` and `.../instincts.md`
- `.github/orchestrator-context.md` — the repo's own profile
- the matched `SKILL.md`

If `activeRepo` is null, fall back to the workspace folder name and warn **once** — not
on every turn.

